      "title": "Response Time vs Load (XY)",
      "description": "Capacity analysis — only meaningful for ladder/stress runs (load ramps within the run). Knee point: RPS plateaus while VUs keep climbing and p95 takes off. Classic response time-load curve: each point is one 5s window.",
